@startuml 19_state_agent_run
!include _style.iuml
title State Machine Diagram (2/5) — AgentRun lifecycle (agent_runs.status) with orchestration sub-states (§10.2)

[*] --> RUNNING : RunRequest accepted\n/ resume_revision = 0

state RUNNING {
  [*] --> LoadContext
  LoadContext --> InterpretRoute : identity, policy and\ncheckpoint consistent
  LoadContext --> [*] : controlled failure
  InterpretRoute --> Agent : agent selected
  InterpretRoute --> Clarify : missing fields
  Agent --> GuardExecute : proposes tool
  Agent --> Finalize : grounded answer
  GuardExecute --> ValidateResult : executor checked schema,\npermission, state, replay
  ValidateResult --> InterpretRoute : refresh / route
  ValidateResult --> Finalize
  Agent --> Handoff : HANDOFF proposal
  Handoff --> LoadContext : target allowed,\ncounters kept
  Clarify --> Finalize
  Finalize --> [*]
}

RUNNING --> WAITING_HUMAN : escalate\n[LOW/UNKNOWN confidence ∨ E02 ∨\nbudget ∨ OUTCOME_UNKNOWN ∨ handoff loop]\n/ Escalation OPEN
WAITING_HUMAN --> RUNNING : authorized resume\n[expected_resume_revision matches]\n/ resume_revision++
WAITING_HUMAN --> FAILED : explicit close / reject
RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED : Finalize [outcome completed\nor clarification sent]
RUNNING --> FAILED : Finalize [safe / dependency failure,\nbudget exhausted]
SUCCEEDED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of WAITING_HUMAN
  No hidden autonomous work while waiting.
  Durable resume (M12) is designed,
  not executed yet (D11).
end note
@enduml
